{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object found, approach and grab it, check properties, perform task, else search for object. list of available nodes: <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <SubTree ID = ApproachAndGrabObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFound    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectValid    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = PerformTaskWithObject    /> <SubTree ID = SearchForObject    />",
